@startuml ShopHub_Data_Flow

' Styling configuration for a clean modern look
skinparam BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam componentStyle uml2
skinparam BoxPadding 10
skinparam ParticipantPadding 10

title ShopHub End-to-End Application Data Flow

actor "Customer / Admin" as User #LightBlue

box "Frontend Layer (Client)" #LightCyan
    participant "React 18 SPA\n(Vite, Tailwind, Recharts)" as UI
end box

box "Security & Backend Router (Server)" #Lavender
    participant "Express Security Middleware\n(Helmet, CORS, Rate-Limit)" as Security
    participant "Express API Router\n(Controllers & Auth Logic)" as API
end box

box "Database & Services" #LightYellow
    database "MongoDB Atlas\n(Mongoose 8)" as DB
    collections "External Services SDK\n(Gemini AI / Stripe / SendGrid)" as Services
end box

' Execution Steps
User -> UI : Interacts with Storefront / Admin Suite
activate UI

UI -> Security : 1. HTTP / REST API Request (Axios with JWT Bearer Token)
activate Security

Security -> API : 2. Passes Firewall Filters (Validates JWT, Rates, & Joi Payloads)
deactivate Security
activate API

API -> DB : 3. Executes Queries / Mutations (CRUD Products, Orders, Analytics)
activate DB
DB --> API : Returns Database Documents
deactivate DB

API -> Services : 4. Third-Party API Orchestration
activate Services
note over Services
    * Gemini AI: Conversational Chat / AI Descriptions
    * Stripe / Razorpay: Idempotent Webhooks & Payments
    * SendGrid: Secure SMTP OTP Verification
end note
Services --> API : Returns External Payload Sync
deactivate Services

API --> UI : 5. Responds with JSON Block (200 OK / Structured Response)
deactivate API

UI --> User : Renders Visual Changes (Recharts / UI Updates)
deactivate UI

@enduml